    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「ああ。先輩ですか」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「……ふむ、触っていいか聞いてくれていたんですね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「それで、わたしが集中しすぎて、生返事を返してしまっていた、と」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「制作に集中しすぎていて、近くにいるのに気づきませんでした。申し訳ないことを、してしまいましたね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「……何を作っているのか、ですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「そうですね、逆に、質問してみましょう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「先輩は、重たい石が空を飛ぶと思いますか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「ふつうは、飛びませんよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「でも、鳥の石像や、それこそ、本当に石が空を飛んでいるような絵を描いてもいい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「わたしがいま作っているのは、そんな自由なオブジェです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「わたしの両親は、私を医学の道に進ませたいようなので、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「もしかしたら決められたレールへの反抗心から、このような、自由な作品を求めたのかもしれません」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「もちろん、消極的な理由で美術部を選んだわけじゃなくて、決め手は楽しいから、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「そして、尊敬できる先輩がいたから、でしたけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「見てください、このモニュメント。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「不規則なうねりを規則的に生み出しながら、それでも、しっかりと根を張るように直立しているんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「空へ空へと、向かおうとしているんです。自由を求めて」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
